; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5213, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\車内.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\路駐運転席メイン.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\クリスタルコア.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The car was running smoothly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But here and there buildings had collapsed or the cherry blossoms had piled up deep, so we couldn't go fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Given the way the blossoms fell yesterday, they could have piled up as high as I am tall by now, but they were 20 centimeters at most.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The blossoms didn't pile up much, did they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe they're different from ordinary cherry blossoms after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The car's tires splashed and sloshed, as if we were driving down a road of slushy snow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't raining, but the road was strangely <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE>.<PG>
Come to think of it, yesterday too, as I walked, a strange, sticky liquid had gradually seeped into my shoes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that the petals are melting, the same as snow...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But for petals to melt...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, like I said before, we're stopping by </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―she'd been looking into things about her and about Arata. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I think she probably has some useful material."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So that's how it is..."</STYLE><PG>
I'd heard that <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>, once called a genius girl, was working as some kind of researcher in Motoki City.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About once every six months, <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> had come to visit me too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd always been small and childlike, and the last time I saw <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>, too, she was so youthful and cheerful she didn't look like she was in her 30s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> I knew had died... 
{PAUSE ""}
I can't help but feel sad, all the same.<PG>
More than that, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> had owed her a great deal too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she has passed on, I'll have to pray properly for her soul.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, why didn't you ever go to Arata before now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Hmm... that's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> was a little evasive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She seemed to have her reasons, but apparently they were hard to tell me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If my intentions and yours, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are at </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="そご">odds</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we might end up at cross-purposes in strange ways from here on."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... you're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, the honest truth is I couldn't go off and leave you behind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If I went to Arata and got caught up in some kind of trouble, there'd be no one left to come and visit you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, right?"</STYLE><PG>
The one holding back the search for <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> had been none other than me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So my being right here in front of <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> now is her chance to go and see <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, is it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This great disaster is a misfortune, but for us it can't be called pure misfortune.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that my shackles are off, things are starting to move again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The car stopped in front of a certain apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even among so many apartment buildings, it was especially big and tall.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you coming too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm coming. Even if she's died in her room, I need to put my hands together for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> properly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thanks."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションエントランス.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Once we were inside, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> unlocked the auto-lock.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you had a key?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> gave me a spare key and said I could come whenever I liked."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh? So that means the power's on here?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"This building has its own power source, separate from the power company. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">See, it generates solar power, and at night and in emergencies it uses the storage batteries. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Looks like it'll keep working for a while yet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What a convenient world it's become."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションエレベーター.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Of the six elevators, we stood in front of the one farthest in, which was, again, especially large.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This one apparently went straight to the top floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―was she really rich or something, maybe...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"She was director of the International Research Institute they opened in Motoki 5 years ago, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So she's still a genius after all... What was she researching?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... it seems her field changed every year."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"She's a genius in any field, then."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\歩く響く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションドア.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―On reaching the top floor, a distinctive smell, unlike the world down below.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An air as if it had never had anything to do with the disaster.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Our footsteps echoed pleasantly across the floor.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"This is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> place."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no way of knowing whether <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> was safe or dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But either way, there was supposed to be information about Arata here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> didn't ring the intercom; she just unlocked the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The door opened easily, and <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> stepped in without hesitation.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm coming in!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No answer came from inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Following <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE> <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="なら">lead</STYLE>, I went inside too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For such a large living room, it didn't feel very lived-in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was furniture that was clearly built in, but apart from that there seemed to be only the bare minimum.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"She's not here... Did she really live here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. Until a year ago she lived in a cheap apartment, but then she suddenly moved here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Maybe she suddenly felt like spending money?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It wasn't like that, though. Apart from where she lived, her life didn't change at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> looked over at one of the doors.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション仕事部屋ドア.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That one's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> workroom."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Her workroom?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. She's never even let me in, but maybe..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> put her hand on the workroom's doorknob.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ドアがちゃがちゃ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
But it seemed to be locked, and it wouldn't open.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Could it be locked from the inside...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\disk-takeout1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Just then, the sound of the electronic lock moving in the knob.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone had unlocked it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア早い開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
Seeing that, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> turned the doorknob with such force she seemed ready to <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="か">sink</STYLE> her teeth into it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I thought you'd come. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\グラスパイン.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! You're okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes! This top floor is completely sealed off from the outside air!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you really all right...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島あいさつ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"It's been a while! Just as I predicted, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She greeted us with that big grin of hers, carrying herself as if she somehow saw right through the situation.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it's crazy outside! Cherry trees came up, and the toxic gas made everyone―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島考える32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please calm down. I'm looking into that right now myself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"For now, let's go to the living room. I'll at least make some tea."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Here you go. It'll warm you up."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\アップルティー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> served us was apple tea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Coffee, maybe, but this was something you'd almost never get in prison.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I accepted it gratefully and enjoyed its aroma and warm flavor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm so glad you're really okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ehe! The genius girl... no, the genius, that's me! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　That said, I ended up letting a lot of people die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Letting people die...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That made it sound as if <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> had caused this disaster...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Are </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you two</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> heading to the Arata settlement after this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, that's the plan."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I can't go with you, but I'd like to give you at least some of the information you'll need, here."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you busy?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, it's that if I go outside, I'll die."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's another strange thing to say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It means <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> dies if she goes outside, but we don't.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"As an anti-terrorism measure, this building is designed so the outside air can be shut out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">This top floor in particular completely replaces the air that comes up in the elevator with visitors. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And the floor and the rooms are ventilated through nano-filters, so I was able to stay alive."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You mean you didn't have to breathe the toxic gas?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes. When the change happened, I just happened to be here, so I was saved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I'd been outside, I wouldn't have made it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understood why <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> was safe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> living in a building this fully protected is far too much of a coincidence.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Because of the toxic gas coming from those cherry trees, Motoki City has become a place where humans can't live. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But the toxic gas doesn't seem to affect you two, just as I thought."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, how do you know so much?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, I was researching it. Those cherry trees, and the Arata settlement too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I kept changing my field to suit my own purposes and collected information that might lead to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Isn't that treating the institute like your own personal property...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ugh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島考える32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">W-well, our interests lined up with the higher-ups', so that's not a problem. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Probably..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. So what <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> had been researching were fields where official research crossed paths with the research she needed to track down <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> whereabouts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, doing 'research' to track down <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> whereabouts seems a little overblown...
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "246" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"First, I'll explain the research I was doing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">The first research was on the goshinboku in Central Park, and next came fungi. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">After that, chemicals in the human brain, and what I'd been doing most recently is research on religion."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The religion research kind of sticks out..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The previous research produced results, so the budget was increased, and a year ago we set up a new research department. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">All of it is research for tracking down </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> whereabouts."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The goshinboku, fungi, brain chemicals, and religion... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They all look unrelated, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes, quite right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I never imagined I'd end up getting my hands into religion either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> set a notepad on the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even now, it seemed, <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan's</STYLE> constant companions were paper and pen.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">"First, I'll tell you why you two don't die even when you breathe this toxic gas. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It's because you two have a special substance inside your bodies."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A special substance...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> probably won't know, but how about you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　You have some idea, don't you?"</STYLE><PG>
A special substance I might have an idea about―
{PAUSE ""}
There's only one thing it could be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The strongest and worst weapon of all, the one that must have made the Megasawa City case possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's more, <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> seems to have already gotten as far as Droga.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I do have an idea..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Thank you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And in </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, too, the same substance―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"W-wait a second! Um, what do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
At that, <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> slowly stood up and opened the room's blinds.
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\blind_up.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond the glass, petals were falling like powder snow, and a cherry tree stood about as tall as this building.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
