<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"What does that look like to you two? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　That thing that looks exactly like a cherry tree―what do you think it is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> is saying that isn't a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can think of a few plants that look like cherries but aren't, but I know of nothing this gigantic.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's a fungus."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A fungus?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's right, a fungus. In other words, it's a mushroom."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's a mushroom...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ridiculous. A mushroom is something more like...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Objections like that are completely meaningless.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
