{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Could it be you get abnormal physical abilities?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Exactly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And extracting the spores from the roots is ridiculously easy―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">you just boil the roots in water."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Just boil them in water...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes. I expect wild animals and such would get the same effect just from eating the roots directly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Even if you refine it, you can make a narcotic so easily an elementary-school science class could probably do it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And when I administered that substance to mice, they developed muscle strength beyond anything normally imaginable."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So that's Droga..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The name of the drug </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gave me."</STYLE><BR>
